The Icon Program Library (IPL): its procedure libraries (procs, gprocs)
and include files (incl, gincl), copied unmodified from the reference
implementation, github.com/gtownsend/icon, by tools/ipl/update.sh.
UPSTREAM records the commit and each file's SHA-256.

gcon searches these directories after IPATH (for link) and LPATH (for
$include). To change a file, copy it to a directory on IPATH or LPATH
rather than editing it here.

These files are in the public domain, as the reference implementation's
README says of its material: "You may use and copy this material freely.
This privilege extends to modifications, although any modified version of
this system given to a third party should clearly identify your
modifications as well as the original source." gprocs/cardbits.icn,
which carries a different licence, is not included.
